meta {
  name: 01 List Devices
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/devices
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  `GET /devices` — the registered fleet of the cheese slicing line.

  **Expect:** two edge IPCs, both in the group `Slicing Line 2 – Cheese`,
  with their UUIDs, serial numbers and TPM public keys:

  - `IPC427E-2024-0417` — the IPC at the weSLICE 6000 slicer,
  - `IPC427E-2024-0208` — the IPC at the weLOAD 3000 infeed loader.

  The line's third IPC — `IPC427E-2025-0093` at the weSCAN 2100 inline
  scanner — is not here yet. We bring it onto the line live in step 04.
}
